<title>CHINA: Erdos Cashmere H1 net rises 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Erdos Cashmere H1 net rises 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	67.088	vs	   53.619</p>
<p>    Turnover	 252.717	vs	  349.395</p>
<p>    Net asset per share	2.45 yuan (no comparative figure)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share	 0.20 yuan (no comparative figure)</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Inner Mongolia Erdos Cashmere Product Co Ltd. Figures were unaudited.</p>
</text>
